boot_at 0650
# Falling off (walker_fell_off) terminates you, and the level starts again where you got up. A
# street's never a fall you can make on purpose, so this film needs a build where any drop over 40
# counts (walker.c, WALKER_LOST_DROP and the "no roof" test, for the film only): booted on 0650,
# the run west drops 50 onto 0640. Shots: the run, the terminal screen typing, and back at the start
wait_up
wait 0.5
shot fr_00_on_0650
keydown up
wait 1.2
shot fr_01
wait 0.3
shot fr_02
keyup up
wait 0.5
shot fr_03_terminal
wait 1.0
shot fr_04_terminal
wait 2.5
shot fr_05_back_at_the_start
wait 1.0
shot fr_06
